{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T12:33:38.453955", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Mapping from direction name to the action index that makes the agent face that direction.\n  # In the Craft environment the action indices are:\n  #   DOWN \u2192 0, UP \u2192 1, LEFT \u2192 2, RIGHT \u2192 3, USE \u2192 4\n  # We assume the agent is already oriented towards `dir`.  The only step required\n  # to try breaking the adjacent obstacle is to execute the USE action.\n  # (If a more sophisticated turning policy is needed it can be added here.)\n  return [4]", "env_interactions": 1, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
