{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T12:34:26.889607", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Retrieve the mapping from action names to integer indices\n  action_map = env.action_specs()\n  actions = []\n\n  # First, move (or turn) towards the specified direction if such an action exists.\n  dir_key = dir.upper()\n  if dir_key in action_map:\n      actions.append(action_map[dir_key])\n\n  # Then issue a USE action to interact with the cell in front.\n  use_action = action_map.get(\"USE\")\n  if use_action is not None:\n      actions.append(use_action)\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": -1}}
