{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T12:58:18.878957", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Default no\u2011op policy: return an empty action sequence.\n  try:\n      if hasattr(env, \"world\") and hasattr(env.world, \"n_actions\"):\n          # The environment knows the action space size, but we choose to\n          # issue no actions.\n          return np.empty(0, dtype=np.int32)\n  except Exception:\n      # In case any attribute access fails, fall back to an empty array.\n      pass\n  return np.array([], dtype=np.int32)", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 0, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
