{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T13:01:33.929963", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize the environment and obtain the set of possible action indices\n  _ = env.reset()\n  action_indices = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  if not action_indices:\n      return []\n\n  # Determine a reasonable step limit (use the environment's max_steps if available)\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 200)\n  steps_taken = 0\n  done = False\n  actions = []\n\n  # Simple random\u2011action loop: keep acting until the episode ends or the step limit is hit\n  while not done and steps_taken < max_steps:\n      a = int(np.random.choice(action_indices))\n      actions.append(a)\n      _, done, _ = env.step(a)\n      steps_taken += 1\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
