{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T13:02:19.427799", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize the environment and obtain the initial observation.\n  # The reset method may accept a seed; we use the default.\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  # Determine the available action indices from the environment's specification.\n  action_space = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  done = False\n  # Run the episode until the environment signals completion.\n  while not done:\n      # Choose an action uniformly at random from the available actions.\n      action = np.random.choice(action_space)\n      # Apply the action to the environment.\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(action)\n      # Record the action taken.\n      actions.append(int(action))\n  # Return the sequence of actions performed during the episode.\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
