{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T13:08:42.630117", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Map direction strings to action indices (DOWN=0, UP=1, LEFT=2, RIGHT=3)\n  dir_map = {\"down\": 0, \"up\": 1, \"left\": 2, \"right\": 3}\n  move_action = dir_map.get(dir.lower())\n  if move_action is None:\n      # Unknown direction \u2013 nothing to do\n      return []\n\n  # The simplest break sequence: face the obstacle (move action) then use the tool.\n  # Action 4 corresponds to the USE action in CraftWorld.\n  return [move_action, 4]", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
