{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T13:33:51.441847", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  done = False\n  steps = 0\n  # Define a hard limit to avoid infinite loops\n  max_steps = 1000\n\n  # Main loop: take random actions until the task is done or the limit is reached\n  while not done and steps < max_steps:\n      # Sample a random action from the available action space\n      action = np.random.randint(env.world.n_actions)\n      # Execute the action; ignore reward and observation details\n      _, done, _ = env.step(action)\n      # Record the action taken\n      actions.append(action)\n      steps += 1\n\n  # Return the sequence of actions performed during the episode\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
