{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T13:34:07.665746", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  try:\n      env.reset()\n  except Exception:\n      # If reset fails for any reason, just continue; the environment may already be reset\n      pass\n\n  actions_taken = []\n  # Use the maximum number of steps defined by the environment if available,\n  # otherwise fall back to a large default.\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n\n  # Simple exhaustive policy: try each possible action in order repeatedly\n  # until the task is completed or we run out of steps.\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      for action in range(5):  # actions: DOWN, UP, LEFT, RIGHT, USE\n          actions_taken.append(action)\n          _, done, _ = env.step(action)\n          if done:\n              return actions_taken\n  # Return whatever actions were taken if the task never finished.\n  return actions_taken", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": -1}}
