{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T13:41:47.276365", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize the environment and collect actions until the episode ends.\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode.\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Retrieve the available action indices from the environment.\n  action_spec = env.action_specs()\n  # action_spec is a dict mapping action names to indices; get the list of indices.\n  action_indices = list(action_spec.values())\n\n  # Loop until the environment signals that the episode is done.\n  while True:\n      # Choose a random action from the available actions.\n      action = np.random.choice(action_indices)\n      actions.append(action)\n\n      # Perform the action in the environment.\n      # The step method returns (reward, done, observations) according to CraftLab API.\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(action)\n\n      # If the episode is finished, exit the loop.\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  # Return the sequence of actions taken.\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
