{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T13:43:39.574825", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  No tool is required to interact with the target cell.\n  This helper returns the action index that corresponds to the USE action,\n  which attempts to collect or interact with the adjacent cell in the given\n  direction. If the environment does not expose an `action_specs` method,\n  it falls back to the default index 4 (the usual index for USE in\n  CraftWorld environments).\n  \"\"\"\n  try:\n      # CraftLab provides a mapping from action names to indices.\n      return [env.action_specs()[\"USE\"]]\n  except Exception:\n      # Default index for the USE action in the standard action space.\n      return [4]", "env_interactions": 1, "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
