{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T14:06:01.723960", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  import numpy as np\n\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  _ = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  done = False\n\n  # Get the list of possible action indices from the environment\n  action_space = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Simple random policy: keep taking random actions until the task is done\n  while not done and len(actions) < 2000:\n      a = int(np.random.choice(action_space))\n      _, done, _ = env.step(a)\n      actions.append(a)\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
