{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T14:08:17.972276", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Simple random policy: keep taking random actions until the episode ends.\n  # Record the sequence of action indices taken and return it.\n  actions = []\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  obs = env.reset()\n  done = False\n  # Obtain the list of possible action indices from the environment spec\n  possible_actions = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  # Run the episode\n  while not done:\n      # Choose a random action\n      act = np.random.choice(possible_actions)\n      # Step the environment\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(int(act))\n      # Record the action taken\n      actions.append(int(act))\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": -1}}
