{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T14:36:11.214004", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Simple random policy: reset the environment and take random actions\n  # until the episode finishes or a step limit is reached.\n  actions = []\n  # Initialise / reset the environment\n  try:\n      env.reset()\n  except Exception:\n      # If reset fails (e.g., already reset), ignore\n      pass\n\n  # Determine the number of possible actions\n  try:\n      n_actions = env.world.n_actions\n  except Exception:\n      # Fallback to a default of 5 (DOWN, UP, LEFT, RIGHT, USE)\n      n_actions = 5\n\n  max_steps = 1000\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Prefer using the environment's action space if available\n      try:\n          action = env.action_space.sample()\n      except Exception:\n          action = np.random.randint(n_actions)\n\n      # Execute the action\n      reward, done, _ = env.step(action)\n      actions.append(action)\n\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
