{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T14:40:22.285999", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment and initialize variables\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  action_space = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  done = False\n\n  # Determine a reasonable step limit\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n\n  # Simple random policy: keep taking random actions until the episode ends\n  while not done and len(actions) < max_steps:\n      a = int(np.random.choice(action_space))\n      actions.append(a)\n      _, done, _ = env.step(a)\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
