{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T14:45:30.285754", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Determine the set of possible action indices from the environment spec\n  action_spec = env.action_specs()\n  possible_actions = list(action_spec.values())\n\n  # Simple random policy: take random actions until the episode ends or a step limit is reached\n  max_steps = 1000\n  done = False\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      if done:\n          break\n      # Sample a random action\n      a = np.random.choice(possible_actions)\n      actions.append(int(a))\n      # Apply the action to the environment\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(a)\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
