{"timestamp": "2025-11-04T14:47:39.374149", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  env.reset()\n  # List to store the sequence of actions taken\n  actions = []\n  # Retrieve the set of possible action IDs from the environment\n  possible_actions = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  # Safety limit to avoid infinite loops in pathological cases\n  max_steps = 10000\n  # Continue taking actions until the task is completed or the safety limit is reached\n  while not env._is_done() and len(actions) < max_steps:\n      # Choose an action uniformly at random\n      act = int(np.random.choice(possible_actions))\n      # Execute the action; env.step returns (reward, done, observation)\n      _, _, _ = env.step(act)\n      # Record the action\n      actions.append(act)\n  # Return the recorded action sequence\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
